bibliograph-web (0.4.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * 0.4.1: catalog pages are ordered by `uri`, not ingest time.

    - `searchEditions` and `resolveEditions` drop `indexed_at` from their
      `ORDER BY`. `uri` is the primary key, so a page is one index scan instead
      of a sort over the whole match set, and the order no longer changes when a
      row is re-ingested. Ranking (`r.rank`) is unchanged; only the tiebreak
      and the unranked page order moved.

