      and their thirteen records move from `net.olamaelcu.livtet.*` to
      `net.olamaelcu.livtet.biblio.*`, whose authority names the publisher DID.
      The retired `biblio.bookReview` document leaves the tree; `authLivtetCore`
      keeps it in its scopes because the sign-in migration still deletes those
