      `subject.uri` and emitting only the union's `#unicodeEmoji` member: the
      union is open, so a later reaction kind is skipped rather than rendered as
      an empty value. A partial index on `(record->'subject'->>'uri')` over
      `community.lexicon.interaction.reaction` covers the read, so reactions are
      counted without a per-request repo scan.
    - The edge forwards `listReactions` and allows it in the metrics
      allow-list; without either the query is uploaded to HappyView but never
      served.

